#: src/Admin/AdminController.php:808
msgid ""
"When Yablonsky SEO owns authority, membership is materialized locally and "
"updated on content/meta events. In Shadow mode background sitemap indexing is"
" paused. Old ready-state buckets stay cold; only affected buckets and the "
"root manifest are invalidated."
msgstr ""
"Ko Yablonsky SEO upravlja javni izhod, se članstvo lokalno izdela in "
"posodablja ob dogodkih vsebine/metapodatkov. V senčnem načinu je indeksiranje"
" zemljevida v ozadju zaustavljeno. Stare pripravljene skupine ostanejo "
"hladne; razveljavijo se le prizadete skupine in korenski manifest."

#: src/Admin/SeoEditorController.php:648
msgid ""
"When Yablonsky SEO owns public authority, expose root /llms.txt plus clean "
".md alternates for public resources. HTML remains canonical and Markdown "
"responses are noindex."
msgstr ""
"Ko Yablonsky SEO upravlja javni izhod, objavi korenski /llms.txt in čiste "
"različice .md za javne vire. HTML ostane kanoničen, odgovori Markdown pa so "
"noindex."

#: src/Admin/AdminController.php:763
msgid ""
"When a published post/page/product or public taxonomy term moves to a new "
"URL, YSEO records a 301 from the previous path to the new canonical URL."
msgstr ""
"Ko se objavljena objava, stran, izdelek ali javni taksonomski izraz premakne "
"na nov URL, YSEO zabeleži preusmeritev 301 s prejšnje poti na novi kanonični "
"URL."

