#: src/Admin/AdminController.php:1271
msgid ""
"YSEO 2.70.0 compared the entire global shadow option after Stage 0 had "
"intentionally mirrored only a subset. 2.70.1 merges verified missing keys per"
" field and does not overwrite differing YSEO values."
msgstr ""
"YSEO 2.70.0 je primerjal celotno globalno senčno možnost, potem ko je faza 0 "
"namenoma zrcalila le podmnožico. Različica 2.70.1 združi preverjene "
"manjkajoče ključe po poljih in ne prepiše različnih vrednosti YSEO."

#: src/SEO/Inspector/FrontEndSeoInspector.php:33
msgid "YSEO Inspector"
msgstr "Pregledovalnik YSEO"

#: src/Admin/AdminController.php:654
msgid ""
"YSEO analyzes visible saved content. Answer-block publishing remains editor-"
"controlled, and the AEO score is a transparent local readiness heuristic."
msgstr ""
"YSEO analizira vidno shranjeno vsebino. Objavljanje blokov z odgovori "
"nadzoruje urednik, ocena AEO pa je pregledna lokalna hevristika "
"pripravljenosti."

#: src/Integrations/SiteKit/SearchPerformanceController.php:149
msgid ""
"YSEO counts privacy-minimised organic landing entrances locally using cookie-"
"free, IP-free local evidence. Search impressions, query text and average "
"ranking position live on the search-engine side and therefore use an "
"authorized connector such as Search Console or another future provider."
msgstr ""
"YSEO lokalno šteje organske obiske pristajalnih strani z dokazi, ki ne "
"uporabljajo piškotkov in IP ter varujejo zasebnost. Prikazi v iskanju, "
"besedilo poizvedb in povprečni položaj uvrstitve sodijo na stran iskalnikov "
"in zato uporabljajo pooblaščen povezovalnik, kot je Search Console ali drug "
"prihodnji ponudnik."

#: src/Admin/SeoEditorController.php:618
msgid ""
"YSEO can publish a root /llms.txt plus optional scoped /section/llms.txt "
"files. Each eligible resource keeps its own clean .md alternate, while the "
"normal HTML URL remains canonical."
msgstr ""
"YSEO lahko objavi korenski /llms.txt in neobvezne lokalne datoteke "
"/section/llms.txt. Vsak primeren vir ohrani svojo čisto različico .md, "
"običajni URL HTML pa ostaja kanoničen."

#: src/Admin/SeoEditorController.php:616
msgid ""
"External CDN/WAF policy remains an edge-layer source of truth. If this site "
"uses Cloudflare and you want Search allowed while Training is refused, verify"
" Cloudflare uses Disallow AI Training instead of Training=Block or Block on "
"pages with ads."
msgstr ""
"Zunanja pravila CDN/WAF ostajajo avtoriteta robne plasti. Če mesto uporablja "
"Cloudflare in želite dovoliti iskanje ter zavrniti učenje, preverite uporabo "
"Disallow AI Training namesto Training=Block ali Block na straneh z oglasi."

#: src/Admin/SeoEditorController.php:1137
msgid ""
"ClaimReview generation is reserved for genuine fact-check workflows where "
"another consumer, such as Fact Check Explorer, still uses it."
msgstr ""
"Ustvarjanje ClaimReview je namenjeno resničnim potekom preverjanja dejstev, "
"kjer ga drug odjemalec, kot je Fact Check Explorer, še uporablja."

#: src/Admin/AdminController.php:768
msgid ""
"Permanent-removal semantics remain explicit. Choose 410 or 451 in Redirect "
"Manager when that semantic is intended."
msgstr ""
"Pomen trajne odstranitve ostaja izrecen. Izberite 410 ali 451 v upravitelju "
"preusmeritev, ko želite ta pomen."

#: src/SEO/NotFound/NotFoundAdminController.php:164
msgid ""
"YSEO emits privacy-light non-SEO evidence for a security provider. A "
"connected provider can consume new observations and historical batches, then "
"assume evidence ownership locally. Blocking, CAPTCHA and rate limits remain "
"security responsibilities."
msgstr ""
"YSEO oddaja zbirne dokaze ne-SEO z varovanjem zasebnosti za varnostnega "
"ponudnika. Povezani ponudnik lahko uporablja nova opažanja in zgodovinske "
"pakete, nato lokalno prevzame lastništvo dokazov. Blokiranje, CAPTCHA in "
"omejitve hitrosti ostajajo varnostne naloge."

#: src/Admin/SeoEditorController.php:378
msgid ""
"YSEO emits verification meta tags only while it owns public SEO output. "
"Verification-tag rendering remains local."
msgstr ""
"YSEO oddaja metaoznake preverjanja samo, ko upravlja javni izhod SEO. Prikaz "
"oznak preverjanja ostaja lokalen."

#: src/Analysis/ReadabilityAnalyzer.php:53
msgid ""
"YSEO evaluates sentence and paragraph structure for this language. Reading-"
"ease scoring activates when a calibrated local formula is bundled."
msgstr ""
"YSEO za ta jezik ocenjuje strukturo stavkov in odstavkov. Ocenjevanje "
"lahkotnosti branja se aktivira, ko je vključen umerjen lokalni obrazec."

#: src/Admin/AdminController.php:323 src/Admin/AdminController.php:1275
msgid "YSEO field"
msgstr "Polje YSEO"

#: src/Admin/SeoEditorController.php:396
msgid ""
"YSEO follows your WordPress user language. Language selection remains aligned"
" with WordPress."
msgstr ""
"YSEO sledi jeziku uporabnika WordPress. Izbira jezika je usklajena z "
"WordPressom."

#: src/Admin/AdminController.php:1104
msgid ""
"YSEO handled the request, but the final MIME type is not XML. A downstream "
"server, proxy or cache layer is rewriting response headers."
msgstr ""
"YSEO je obdelal zahtevo, vendar končna vrsta MIME ni XML. Strežnik, posrednik"
" ali predpomnilnik v nadaljnji poti prepisuje glave odgovora."

#: src/Admin/AdminController.php:781
msgid ""
"YSEO indexes links found in saved public post/page/product content, counts "
"inbound and outbound relationships, surfaces orphaned resources and suggests "
"unused contextual targets from shared taxonomy and title evidence. Link "
"insertion remains editor-controlled."
msgstr ""
"YSEO indeksira povezave iz shranjene javne vsebine objav/strani/izdelkov, "
"šteje vhodna in izhodna razmerja, prikazuje osirotele vire in predlaga "
"neuporabljene kontekstne cilje na podlagi skupne taksonomije in naslovov. "
"Vstavljanje povezav nadzoruje urednik."

#: src/Admin/AdminController.php:308
msgid "YSEO is changing the public authority only after verified shadow parity."
msgstr "YSEO spreminja javno avtoriteto šele po preverjenem senčnem ujemanju."

#: src/Admin/SeoEditorController.php:1131
msgid ""
"YSEO keeps Schema.org semantics distinct from the features currently "
"supported by individual search surfaces. Valid markup expresses semantic "
"correctness; Google rich-result eligibility follows Google’s supported "
"feature set."
msgstr ""
"YSEO ločuje semantiko Schema.org od funkcij, ki jih trenutno podpirajo "
"posamezni iskalni sistemi. Veljavna oznaka izraža semantično pravilnost; "
"upravičenost do Googlovih obogatenih rezultatov sledi Googlovim podprtim "
"funkcijam."

#: src/Analysis/ReadabilityAnalyzer.php:37
msgid ""
"YSEO needs complete sentence-level text before it can evaluate sentence "
"structure."
msgstr "YSEO za oceno strukture stavkov potrebuje celotno besedilo na ravni stavkov."

#: src/Analysis/ReadabilityAnalyzer.php:93
msgid ""
"YSEO needs sentence punctuation before it can evaluate compact-script "
"sentence structure."
msgstr ""
"YSEO za oceno strukture stavkov v pisavah brez presledkov potrebuje stavčna "
"ločila."

#: src/Visibility/ReadinessAudit.php:83
msgid ""
"YSEO provides the [yseo_preferred_source] shortcode as an optional static "
"link. It uses zero Google JavaScript; ranking and AI-visibility outcomes "
"remain external."
msgstr ""
"YSEO ponuja kratko kodo [yseo_preferred_source] kot neobvezno statično "
"povezavo. Ne uporablja Googlovega JavaScripta; rezultati uvrstitve in "
"vidnosti AI ostajajo odvisni od zunanjih sistemov."

#: src/SEO/Sitemap/SitemapsAdminController.php:130
msgid "YSEO recommendation"
msgstr "Priporočilo YSEO"

#: src/Admin/AdminController.php:1088
msgid "YSEO route not reached"
msgstr "Pot YSEO ni dosežena"

#: src/Admin/AdminController.php:1222
msgid ""
"YSEO shadow data matches the verified source evidence. Yoast is still live "
"until you explicitly confirm public takeover."
msgstr ""
"Senčni podatki YSEO se ujemajo s preverjenimi dokazi vira. Yoast ostane "
"aktiven, dokler izrecno ne potrdite javnega prevzema."

#: src/Admin/SeoEditorController.php:608
msgid ""
"YSEO stores four separate policy intents. robots.txt tokens, provider "
"consoles, meta/X-Robots controls, CDN/WAF policy and future standards can map"
" onto those intents while the administrator-facing model remains stable."
msgstr ""
"YSEO hrani štiri ločene namene pravil. Žetoni robots.txt, konzole ponudnikov,"
" nadzor meta/X-Robots, pravila CDN/WAF in prihodnji standardi se lahko "
"preslikajo nanje, model za skrbnika pa ostane stabilen."

#: src/Admin/AdminController.php:1105
msgid ""
"YSEO transport headers are present, but the returned body does not begin as "
"an XML sitemap document."
msgstr ""
"Glave prenosa YSEO so prisotne, vendar vrnjeno telo ni dokument zemljevida "
"XML."

#: src/Admin/AdminController.php:295
msgid ""
"YSEO will verify the source, create a rollback backup and import to shadow "
"storage. Public SEO remains with Yoast."
msgstr ""
"YSEO preveri vir, ustvari varnostno kopijo za povrnitev in uvozi v senčno "
"shrambo. Javni SEO ostaja pri Yoastu."

